    "tactics": "",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Slam [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 6 + Melee Combat 3), Reach: 10 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 11 damage (5 + 6 Str) + 3 fire damage (Half DR).</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 11 damage, DR halved (round up) + 3 fire damage; target gains Ignited condition.</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 3:</strong> 11 damage, DR halved (round up) + 3 fire damage; target gains Burning condition</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Lava Splash (Recharge 5-8) [Combat]: Slams the ground, sending molten rock in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in area makes a Reflex save. Compare Agil 3 + Melee Combat 5 targeting vs. save successes.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 8 fire damage (Half DR) + Singed.</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 8 fire damage, DR halved (round up) + Ignited. Net 3: 16 fire damage + Burning.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Heat Aura: Creatures starting their turn within 5 feet take 4 fire damage (Half DR). Burrow: Moves through earth and stone at burrow speed, leaving a tunnel large enough for a Medium creature. Tunnel walls remain hot for 10 minutes after passage. 4 fire damage to creatures who touch them.</p>",
